n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                \n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Detailed SEO Extension<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/detailed-seo-extension.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14498\" style=\"width:110px;height:auto\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/chromewebstore.google.com\/detail\/pfjdepjjfjjahkjfpkcgfmfhmnakjfba?utm_source=item-share-cb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Detailed SEO Extension<\/a> is a highly efficient tool designed for quick and precise on-page SEO analysis. With a single click, it displays key data, including meta titles, descriptions, headers, structured data, and links, on any webpage. This SEO extension is particularly useful for identifying common on-page issues, such as missing tags, duplicate content, or incorrect metadata. It provides an easy-to-navigate interface, making it a favorite among SEO professionals who want actionable insights instantly. Whether you\u2019re auditing your site or analyzing competitors, Detailed SEO Extension saves time and effort by offering a complete overview without switching tools.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Uses:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Quickly analyze on-page elements, including title tags, meta descriptions, headers, and structured data.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Identify missing or duplicate tags that could affect search rankings.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Check internal and external links on a page.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Features:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Instant on-page SEO audits.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Information on meta tags, headings, and Open Graph data.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy-to-understand dashboard for SEO professionals.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. SEOquake<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/seoquake.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14497\" style=\"width:129px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/seoquake.webp 400w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/seoquake-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/seoquake-150x150.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/chromewebstore.google.com\/detail\/akdgnmcogleenhbclghghlkkdndkjdjc?utm_source=item-share-cb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEOquake<\/a> by SEMrush is a widely used Chrome extension for SEO, providing instant access to comprehensive <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/seo-kpis\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SEO metrics<\/a> directly in your browser. It offers an on-page audit, backlink analysis, domain comparison, and keyword density reports. With its <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/serp\/\">SERP<\/a> overlay feature, you can view critical ranking data right within the search results. The extension is ideal for marketers and SEO specialists who want to perform quick audits, competitor research, and analyze page authority metrics on the go. It also integrates seamlessly with SEMrush for deeper insights, making it a must-have for both beginners and advanced SEO professionals.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Uses:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Analyze key SEO metrics like page rank, domain age, and traffic data.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perform an instant SEO audit of a page.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Compare URLs and domains in real-time.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Features:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>On-page SEO audit tool.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>SERP overlay with useful SEO metrics.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Keyword density report and link analysis.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Redirect Path<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/redirect-path.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14495\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/chromewebstore.google.com\/detail\/aomidfkchockcldhbkggjokdkkebmdll?utm_source=item-share-cb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Redirect Path<\/a> is a simple yet powerful tool that focuses on detecting HTTP status codes, including 301, 302, 404, and 500 responses. It helps you quickly diagnose redirection issues that can negatively impact SEO, such as redirect chains or loops. The extension is particularly useful for <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/technical-seo\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">technical SEO<\/a> audits, where ensuring the correct use of redirects is crucial for maintaining link equity and proper indexing. Redirect Path also highlights client-side redirects, such as those triggered by meta refreshes or JavaScript. With a straightforward interface and instant results, it\u2019s an essential tool for identifying site errors and optimizing crawlability.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Uses:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Diagnose redirect issues that could harm SEO performance.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Check if redirects are properly implemented for SEO purposes.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quickly analyze HTTP headers.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Features:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Identifies 301, 302, 404, and 500 status codes.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Shows client-side redirects such as meta and JavaScript.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Simple interface with instant results.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T112145_393_1785491880854_775860.webp\" alt=\"Cracking Meta &amp; Google Ads 2026 - Data, Automation &amp; Attribution\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/ai-engineering-roadmap-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T123426_340_1785490284771_211381.webp\" alt=\"AI Engineering Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/how-to-build-an-ai-agent-from-scratch?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-03T133829_740__1__1786010890597_768466.webp\" alt=\"How to Build an AI Agent from Scratch \" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/soc-analyst-career-demand-in-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-04T111115_404_1786011909630_974751.webp\" alt=\"SOC Analyst Career Demand in 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/booming-digital-marketing-career-in-ai-era?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-07T104930_382_1786105407836_186872.webp\" alt=\"Booming Digital Marketing Career in AI Era\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cybersecurity-professional-career-roadmap-2026-2?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-08-05T122121_005_1786351858212_930412.webp\" alt=\"Cybersecurity Professional Career Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Keyword Surfer<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/keyword-surfer.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14494\" style=\"width:139px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.