n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Check My Links<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/check-my-links.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14493\" style=\"width:151px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/check-my-links.jpg 225w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/check-my-links-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/chromewebstore.google.com\/detail\/aajoalonednamcpodaeocebfgldhcpbe?utm_source=item-share-cb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Check My Links<\/a> is an essential tool for link audits, designed to scan entire webpages and highlight broken or inactive links in seconds. It visually marks valid links in green and broken ones in red, making it easy to identify issues that could hurt user experience and SEO. This extension is particularly useful for website audits, content updates, and outreach campaigns where maintaining active links is critical. With its ability to handle pages with hundreds of links, Check My Links saves hours of manual checking, ensuring your site remains optimized for both search engines and users.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Uses:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Identify broken internal and external links for SEO cleanup.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Speed up link audits on large web pages.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ensure a smooth user experience with active links.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Key Features:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Highlights valid and broken links in real-time.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy-to-use scanning feature.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Works efficiently on pages with hundreds of links.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Als